     "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">Hello Alexander,</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">(now to the entire list, for future reference)</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">In the previous message where the email list was not in the recipients, you&#39;ve sent an MRE which I was able to use and replicate your error. It seems to be due to a bug in package SetMethods (and I added there Nena Oana in the CC).</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">INNOV2added &lt;- data.frame(</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">   row.names = c(&quot;Bulgaria16”, &quot;Bulgaria18”, &quot;Estonia16&quot;,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">                 &quot;Estonia18”, &quot;Czech Republic16”, &quot;Czech Republic18&quot;),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">  highpatent = c(0, 0, 0, 0, 0.67, 1),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">     highinv = c(0.33, 0.33, 1, 1, 1, 1),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">   highlinks = c(0, 0, 1, 0.67, 1, 0),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">     highfdi = c(0.67, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">    highesif = c(0, 0.33, 0, 0.67, 0, 1),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">    hightax2 = c(0, 0, 0, 0, 0.67, 0.67),</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">     lowflow = c(0.33, 0.33, 0.67, 1, 0, 0)</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">)</font></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">T &lt;- truthTable(</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       data = INNOV2added,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       outcome = &quot;highpatent&quot;,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       incl.cut = 0.8,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       pri.cut = 0.51,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       n.cut = 1,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       <a href=\"http://sort.by\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sort.by&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494727246000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YvgdtRaVIQ8LxsVAJdLUu\">sort.by</a> = &quot;incl&quot;,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">       show.cases = TRUE</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\" color=\"#000000\">)</font><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\">solT &lt;- minimize(input = T, details = TRUE)<br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\">pimplot(data = INNOV2added, outcome = &quot;highpatent&quot;, results = solT)</font></div>"
