     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">So that does yield an error. The fix is to rename all columns to uppercase:</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\">names(INNOV2added) &lt;- <font>toupper(names(</font>INNOV2added))</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">T2 &lt;- truthTable(</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       data = INNOV2added,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       outcome = &quot;HIGHPATENT&quot;,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       incl.cut = 0.8,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       pri.cut = 0.51,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       n.cut = 1,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       <a href=\"http://sort.by\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sort.by&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494727246000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YvgdtRaVIQ8LxsVAJdLUu\">sort.by</a> = &quot;incl&quot;,</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">       show.cases = TRUE</font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">)</font></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\">solT2 &lt;- minimize(input = T2, details = TRUE)<br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Courier New\"><font>pimplot(data = INNOV2added, outcome = </font>&quot;<font>HIGHPATENT&quot;, results = solT2)</font></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><font face=\"ui-sans-serif, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><font face=\"ui-sans-serif, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system\"><font face=\"ui-sans-serif, sans-serif\">And this works as expected. The key to solve these kinds of errors is to check what is different in your example, compared with the example that actually works in the help file of the function pimplot(). This is how I figured out the only possible difference is the case sensitivity.</font></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">I hope this helps,</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px\">Adrian</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wednesday, 22 March 2023 at 23:32:12 UTC+2 Alexander Strelkov wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>Dear Ingo, good evening</div><div>    Thank you very much, I checked the column names and &quot;highpatent&quot; is there...So I should potentially be using the xyplot? <br></div><div>And I am always positively amazed to meet people (online or offline) whose work I read, thank you:)<br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wednesday, 22 March 2023 at 13:17:52 UTC+1 Ingo Rohlfing wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n  \r\n    \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:1px\">\r\n    <p><font face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\">Dear Alexander,</font></p>\r\n    <p>pimplot() and truthTable() belong to different packages, so\r\n      getting an error message for one function and not the other can\r\n      happen. <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>The message reads such that there is no column highpatent in the\r\n      results object that could be fed into the plotting function. I\r\n      remember I once had the same problem, but, unfortunately, I don&#39;t\r\n      remember whether and how I could fix it. You may check the column\r\n      names in solT$tt$recoded.data to see whether highpatent is\r\n      included. It could be an upper-case/lower-case issue, but I don&#39;t\r\n      think so because this should happen to everyone.</p>\r\n    <p>I am sorry I don&#39;t have a quick fix to offer.<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>Kind regards</p>\r\n    <p>Ingo<br>\r\n    </p></div><div style=\"padding-bottom:1px\">\r\n    <p><br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div>Am 22.03.2023 um 10:26 schrieb\r\n      Alexander Strelkov:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div><div style=\"padding-bottom:1px\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div>Dear group members, good morning</div>\r\n      <div>    I am having another &quot;novice&quot; question. I am trying to\r\n        plot the results of the minimized truth table with pimplot and\r\n        QCA radar function. Yet I have the same mistake every time.</div>\r\n      <div>\r\n        <span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;border:medium none;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;width:1251.26px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;line-height:1.2;font-size:10pt;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\">\r\n<span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10pt;outline:none;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:blue\">pimplot(data = INNOV2added,outcome = &quot;highpatent&quot;,results = solT,all_labels = TRUE,jitter = TRUE,fontsize = 6)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in `[.data.frame`(results$tt$recoded.data, , outcome) : \r\n  undefined columns selected\r\n</span></span></span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;line-height:1.2;font-size:10pt;vertical-align:top\" align=\"left\"></span></span></span></span>\r\n        <span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:blue\">QCAradar(results = solT,outcome = &quot;highpatent&quot;,fit = FALSE)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in `[.data.frame`(results$tt$recoded.data, , outcome) : \r\n  undefined columns selected</span></span></span> <br>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div><br>\r\n        <span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;border:medium none;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;width:1251.26px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><span>If I understand correctly, it is something wrong with the way outcome is presented (i.e. &quot;highpatent&quot; is not &quot;dropping down&quot; after I type &quot;outcome=&quot;.</span></span></div>\r\n      <div><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;border:medium none;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;width:1251.26px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><span>When I was minimizing the truth table there were not problems with &quot;highpatent&quot; as outcome.</span></span></div>\r\n      <div><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2;border:medium none;outline:none;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;width:1251.26px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><span>Your advice is very much appreciated!\r\n</span></span></div></blockquote></div><div style=\"padding-bottom:1px\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      -- <br>\r\n      You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google\r\n      Groups &quot;QCA with R&quot; group.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it,\r\n      send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">qcawithr+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n      To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/qcawithr/a4b339af-3d21-476c-b0d7-04bd43092120n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/qcawithr/a4b339af-3d21-476c-b0d7-04bd43092120n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494727246000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ktC9rjQL_AhZYn9qwvL8n\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/qcawithr/a4b339af-3d21-476c-b0d7-04bd43092120n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n    </blockquote>\r\n    <pre cols=\"72\">-- \r\nProfessor für Methoden der Empirischen Sozialforschung (Methods for Empirical Social Research)\r\nphone: <a href=\"tel:+49%20851%205092720\" value=\"+498515092720\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">+49 851 509